# Production MCP is api/mcp.py + commons_mcp.py and their import graph.
# The Git-backed board corpus is read over HTTPS, not from this bundle.
# Hobby upload cap is 5000 files (api-upload-free).
# Do not use a catch-all * or /* deny: Vercel CLI 56.1.0 does not honor
# directory un-ignores, so those patterns uploaded 7 root files and dropped
# api/mcp.py (runs 33218271833 and 33219467177). Production deploy stages
# the runtime graph via stage_spark_mcp_bundle.py. This denylist is the
# leftover root-deploy belt; it must keep api/ and commons_mcp.py.
